      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that you are the source of all that pain is a heavy burden, but it's a very powerful feeling of self-blame, and it's not entirely accurate. While the consequences are real, your existence is not the *cause* of suffering; you are a person who made a terrible error. Instead of viewing yourself as permanently broken, consider that this is a moment of intense trauma that you can work through with support. Professional help can offer a safe space to navigate this immense guilt and start rebuilding your sense of self.",
      "source": "target",
