    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to \"work through\" it. that just implies i'm supposed to keep living with this. but what if the only way to truly stop being the problem is to actually stop? like, if i'm the source of the rot, then why should i be allowed to keep existing? it feels more like a matter of justice than just \"trauma.\" if i'm a stain, shouldn't a stain be washed away?",
